Chapter: Tier One Latin Print

 Two-byte CCE characters from the first two tier-1 slices, U+0080 to U+017F,
 printed through print-line-uni beside controls from slices 2 and 3.

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("slice 0: ß ¿")
    print-line-uni ("slice 1: ğ ş Œ")
    print-line-uni ("slice 2: Ж")
    print-line-uni ("slice 3: Ω")
  end

